@wojtek-t -- I can take this up. One question I had was should the `takeAvailable` method rely on `time.Now()` or the current time should be passed on by the caller like in the following:

https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/master/vendor/golang.org/x/time/rate/rate.go#L307-L310

Having the caller pass the time completely removes the dependency on the clock at least for the `timeBudget` implementation.
